{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topobeam is a puzzle game about redirecting lasers in different two-dimensional manifolds.\u00a0 The levels operate on a grid system, but pay attention to how the sides of the grid are glued together as players, objects, and lasers can cross over these gluings to different parts of the level.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/extras/75202c1d34c9cd9e8558c047885dd229.avif?t=1761338282\" width=1480 height=858 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/extras/96766207bcc6b0ae130a51160629ccf5.avif?t=1761338282\" width=1480 height=858 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gluing allows for many interesting phenomena central to solutions including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to make a laser run in a loop without cutting the inside off from the outside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability make a laser turn without a mirror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to reorient objects by pushing them in a carefully-chosen loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability for a laser to make a loop with fewer than three 90-degree turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to get the inside piece out of the box:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/extras/e30e0d7a8deff8d2119883d323a5d1d6.avif?t=1761338282\" width=331 height=337 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119430?t=1761338282","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4119430?t=1761338282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/63a9333d09f6a4fea4a7a48bf154ab0f90015eb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761338282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/63a9333d09f6a4fea4a7a48bf154ab0f90015eb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761338282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topobeam is a puzzle game about redirecting lasers in different two-dimensional manifolds.\u00a0 The levels operate on a grid system, but pay attention to how the sides of the grid are glued together as players, objects, and lasers can cross over these gluings to different parts of the level.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/extras/75202c1d34c9cd9e8558c047885dd229.avif?t=1761338282\" width=1480 height=858 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/extras/96766207bcc6b0ae130a51160629ccf5.avif?t=1761338282\" width=1480 height=858 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gluing allows for many interesting phenomena central to solutions including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to make a laser run in a loop without cutting the inside off from the outside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability make a laser turn without a mirror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to reorient objects by pushing them in a carefully-chosen loop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability for a laser to make a loop with fewer than three 90-degree turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to get the inside piece out of the box:</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/extras/e30e0d7a8deff8d2119883d323a5d1d6.avif?t=1761338282\" width=331 height=337 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much, much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Nathaniel Hohnbaum"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4119430/1a666c7d15d6a1d5511ce55337f748774ed3ca40/header.jpg?t=1761338282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4119430/1651970766/7e865a3bc2e16954606eb7c0cc5686410e560e4e/1760974048/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761338280","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4119430/1651970766/7e865a3bc2e16954606eb7c0cc5686410e560e4e/1760974048/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761338280","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4119430/1651970766/7e865a3bc2e16954606eb7c0cc5686410e560e4e/1760974048/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761338280","id":257219461,"name":"Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257219461/7520f0b9bb0fe6cb3cc6b7d96ea959014b98cf6a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761338280"}],"name":"Topobeam","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Nathaniel Ho